# Copy to `.openrocket-src` (gitignored) and put the path to your local
# OpenRocket 24.12 checkout on one line — the directory that contains core/.
#
# Only the maintenance scripts need this:
#   node engine-java/scripts/carve.mjs
#   node packages/app/scripts/fetch-component-presets.mjs
# A normal `npm run build` does not: the compiled kernel is committed at
# packages/engine/vendor/orkengine.mjs.
#
# You can use the OPENROCKET_SRC environment variable instead.
/path/to/openrocket-release-24.12
